{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《English Listening Master Pro》是一款透過真實英語對話聽寫來訓練聆聽能力的教育遊戲，適合兒童、學生、長者及任何想提升英語聆聽技巧的人士。目前正在限時免費，原價 US $8.99。</p>\n\n<h2>真實聆聽訓練</h2>\n<p>遊戲利用來自數千位不同母語者在真實環境中的錄音，配合背景噪音鍛煉聆聽；玩家可選 Easy、Competent、Expert 三種作答模式，並挑戰 Beginner 至 Expert 四個難度等級。支援單人與多人模式，可獨自練習、與朋友比拼，或挑戰來自世界各地的玩家。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：English Listening Master Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T22:38:44.321473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}